      plain: 'Stacks or compares two lists that have the same columns.',
      lesson: 'Set operators work on whole lists. UNION stacks two lists and removes repeats; UNION ALL keeps repeats. INTERSECT keeps what’s in both. EXCEPT keeps what’s in the first list but not the second. Both lists need the same number of columns, in the same order.',
